          </div>

          <h2 className="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
            The Zero-Recommendation Paradox: Why AI Search is Siphoning Your Pipeline
          </h2>

          <div className="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
            <p>
              In 2026, over <strong className="text-white">90% of accounting, finance, and BPO buyers</strong> consult generative answer engines (ChatGPT Search, Perplexity Pro, Claude) to build vendor shortlists before speaking with sales.
            </p>
            <div className="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
              <div className="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
                <div className="text-xs text-zinc-400 uppercase font-mono">Branded Verification</div>
                <div className="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400">100% Verified</div>
                <p className="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500">Clients who specifically search for your name find verified reviews and delivery credibility.</p>
              </div>
              <div className="p-4 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/[0.05]">
                <div className="text-xs text-red-300 uppercase font-mono">Commercial Recommendation</div>
                <div className="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-red-400">0.0% Primary Win</div>
                <p className="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-400">Across non-branded high-intent buyer queries, the models recommend competitors in 100% of scenarios.</p>
              </div>
              <div className="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
                <div className="text-xs text-zinc-400 uppercase font-mono">Competitor Inception</div>
                <div className="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400">Recurring Industry Leaders</div>
