            </div>
            <p className="text-zinc-400 text-xs pt-1">
              <strong className="text-zinc-200">The Bottom Line:</strong> Your loss is not caused by poor service delivery; it is an addressable indexing gap. Competitors publish machine-readable practice and compliance case studies that retrieval engines cite. Deploying 3 targeted use-case assets closes this gap and shifts your brand into the primary shortlist.
            </p>
          </div>
